msgid "Your browser opens Yuva. Sign in with a one-time code; a new e-mail address gets a new account."
msgstr "Pelayar anda membuka Yuva. Log masuk dengan kod sekali guna; alamat e-mel baharu mendapat akaun baharu."

#: src/copy/ai.ts
msgid "Your code stays on your machine. Yuva only sees what the assistant creates through it."
msgstr "Kod anda kekal pada mesin anda. Yuva hanya melihat apa yang dicipta pembantu melaluinya."

#: src/copy/cloudflare-email.ts
msgid "Your team answers in the panel. The reply is sent through the e-mail channel's own SMTP account, such as Amazon SES, Postmark or your own relay, from the same address and in the same thread. Replies do not go through the Worker."
msgstr "Pasukan anda menjawab dalam panel. Balasan dihantar melalui akaun SMTP saluran e-mel itu sendiri, seperti Amazon SES, Postmark atau geganti anda sendiri, dari alamat yang sama dan dalam utas yang sama. Balasan tidak melalui Worker."

